{
  "name": "06-domain-enrichment Domain Enrichment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 06 Domain Enrichment\n\nCompany size, industry, tech and socials from a domain, behind a cache and a pluggable provider interface.\n\n**Safety rails:** Does not gate on the rails - it never contacts a prospect. It does spend money, so it writes every paid lookup to the spend ledger the rails read for the daily cap.\n\n**Before you enable this:** replace every REPLACE_WITH_* value, point CRM_BASE_URL/CRM_ADAPTER at your CRM, and run it once manually with test data.\n\nDocs: README.md, docs/SETUP.md, docs/COMPLIANCE.md",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ],
      "id": "02b8a122-9da5-6915-a071-2b95507e1b22",
      "name": "Read Me"
    },
